      <strong>Genome<br />Assemblies</strong>
    </div>
    <div class="mgdb-hero-body">
      <h1 id="manifesto-title">Maize Genome Assemblies and Annotations</h1>
      <p class="mgdb-hero-description">How the maize reference genome has been built and rebuilt since 2009, what came with the NAM founders and the pan-genes, and what MaizeGDB asks of a group planning a new maize genome.</p>
      <p class="manifesto-contact">Planning an assembly or annotation project and need to document MaizeGDB's involvement? Write to <a href="mailto:carson.andorf@ars.usda.gov,maizegdb_support@iastate.edu?subject=%5BMAIZEGDB-ASSEMBLY%5D%20Letter%20of%20collaboration%20request">Carson Andorf and the MaizeGDB team</a> for a letter of collaboration.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <nav class="mgdb-section-tabs" aria-label="Sections on this page">
    <a href="#b73-assembly" class="is-current" aria-current="true">B73 reference</a>
    <a href="#nam-founders">NAM founders</a>
    <a href="#more-assemblies">More assemblies</a>
    <a href="#pan-genes">Pan-genes</a>
